    "## Results\n",
    "\n",
    "### Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "In our EDA, we will explore the two processed datasets to evaluate the individual and combined predictive power of quarter-by-quarter scoring and team box score metrics. Our EDA is divided into 3 main objectives:\n",
    "1. Exploring the Target Variable: Defining and exploring our dependent variable: whether the betting favorite covered the spread.\n",
    "2. Feature Set 1 Analysis (Intra-game Scoring): Analyzing how quarter-by-quarter point differentials relate to spread coverage.\n",
    "3. Feature Set 2 Analysis (Team Box Scores): Analyzing how traditional efficiency metrics like FG% and Rebounds correlate with our target variable.\n",
    "\n",
    "We start our EDA process by loading our clean data from the data/02-processed directory."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
